---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Alex Ney — Operating Partner, Advisor, CPA.">
  <div class="page-hero">
    <p class="page-hero__label">About</p>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">Alex Ney</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__description">Operating Partner & Advisor · CPA · Miami, FL</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-body">
    <p>
      Alex Ney is an operating executive, CPA, and trusted advisor to founders, PE-backed businesses,
      and management teams navigating complex transformations. He brings a rare combination of
      hands-on operational experience, deep financial expertise, and a builder's instinct for
      what actually moves the needle.
    </p>

    <p>
      He currently serves as <strong>Operating Partner at Aegeus Group</strong> — a Ten Oaks Group
      portfolio company — where he leads strategy, operations, and value creation for a $100M+ revenue
      Testing, Inspection, Certification & Compliance (TICC) business serving Oil & Gas asset owners.
      Alongside that, he advises founders and business owners through <strong>Ney Advisors</strong>,
      providing financial, transactional, and strategic counsel across diverse engagements.
    </p>

    <p>
      Before moving into operating roles, Alex spent nearly a decade in advisory services. As
      <strong>Associate Director at CrossCountry Consulting</strong>, he partnered with private equity
      sponsors and executive teams on enterprise-wide finance transformations, M&A execution, ERP
      implementations, and CFO office buildouts for middle-market and upper middle-market companies.
    </p>

    <p>
      Prior to CrossCountry, Alex was at <strong>Berkeley Research Group</strong>, where he mastered
      financial due diligence and quality of earnings across 100+ buy-side and sell-side transactions
      spanning healthcare, technology, professional services, and manufacturing. His career began at
      <strong>Ernst & Young</strong> in Chicago, in the Financial Services assurance practice.
    </p>

    <p>
      Alex holds a <strong>B.S. in Finance and Accounting</strong> from the Kelley School of Business
      at Indiana University and is a licensed <strong>CPA</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-body {
    max-width: 680px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about-body strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
